menu "WaveMaster"

    config WM_DEBUG
        bool "Debug instrumentation for resets and freezes"
        default n
        help
            Adds the diagnostics in src/debug_tools.c and src/freeze_watch.c: the core 1 task sampler, the task
            watchdog hook, per-task stack watermarks, the core dump report and the core 0 stall detector. They
            all log through the ESPFleet agent. Off in a normal build; the esp32-s3-devkitc-1-debug PlatformIO
            environment turns it on (together with the coredump and watchdog-panic settings in sdkconfig.debug).

endmenu
